{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x08---lisa-on-ice",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x08 - Lisa on Ice",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x08 - Lisa on Ice.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:02.453Z",
  "lineCount": 281,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Lisa on Ice",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 0
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "It's Channel 6 Action News.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 27085,
      "endMs": 29838
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Ah, Action News.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 31506,
      "endMs": 33300
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The last place an impressionable kid can go for TV violence.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33467,
      "endMs": 36303
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Now here's your Action anchor, Kent Brockman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 36470,
      "endMs": 39431
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Hello, I'm Kent Brockman! Our top stories tonight: A tremendous explosion in the price of lumber.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39598,
      "endMs": 44186
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "\"President Reagan dyes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44353,
      "endMs": 46563
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "...his hair, \" says Gary Trudeau in his new musical comedy review.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 46730,
      "endMs": 49691
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "But first let's check the death count from the killer storm...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49858,
      "endMs": 52986
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "...bearing down on us like a shotgun full of snow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53153,
      "endMs": 55781
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "As of now, the death count is zero. But it is ready to shoot right up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57407,
      "endMs": 60869
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Oh, my God! Damn you, snow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61119,
      "endMs": 64539
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "All right! Snow day! No school tomorrow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64748,
      "endMs": 67584
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "That doesn't mean no book report. What if the weatherman is wrong?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 69044,
      "endMs": 72172
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Lisa, that man is a professional meteorologist.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72939,
      "endMs": 75650
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Kent, I'd like to remind everybody to come down and watch me...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75817,
      "endMs": 78695
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "...at the Springfield Laugh and Brew and Burgers and Fries on Saturday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 78861,
      "endMs": 82073
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "The forecast calls for a 75%/% chance of hilarity.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82240,
      "endMs": 85910
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "I like those odds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86119,
      "endMs": 87453
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Snowball fight!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89330,
      "endMs": 90873
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "You're gonna eat a blizzard of...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99591,
      "endMs": 101634
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "...unseasonable warmth?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 101843,
      "endMs": 103720
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "I made the snowball from the frost in our freezer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103886,
      "endMs": 106889
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Nice P.J. S, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108808,
      "endMs": 110977
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Did your mommy buy them for you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 112144,
      "endMs": 114229
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Of course she did. Who else would have?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 114605,
      "endMs": 116398
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "All right, Simpson. You win this round.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118066,
      "endMs": 122529
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Okay, it's book report time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123113,
      "endMs": 124907
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "We'll do them alphabetically. Today it's A through M.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 125115,
      "endMs": 128660
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I'm saved! I love being a Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128869,
      "endMs": 131997
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Let's see. We have no A's.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 132205,
      "endMs": 133749
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "So let's go right to the B's. Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133874,
      "endMs": 135918
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Mrs. Krabappel...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137210,
      "endMs": 138629
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "...I didn't...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138795,
      "endMs": 140964
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Attention. This is Principal Skinner...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141131,
      "endMs": 143008
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "...your principal, with a message from the principal's office.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143216,
      "endMs": 146136
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "All students proceed immediately to an assembly...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146303,
      "endMs": 148805
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "...in the Butthead Memorial Auditorium.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149014,
      "endMs": 150641
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Damn it, I wish we hadn't let the students name that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150933,
      "endMs": 153352
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Children, the times they are becoming quite different.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153560,
      "endMs": 157147
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Test scores are at an all-time low.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157481,
      "endMs": 159775
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "So I've come up with these academic alerts!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159942,
      "endMs": 162819
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "You will receive one as soon as your grades start to slip in any subject.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163986,
      "endMs": 167698
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Your parents won't have to wait until report cards to punish you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167865,
      "endMs": 170826
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "How innovative. I like it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 171035,
      "endMs": 172828
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Hey, Dolph, take a memo on your Newton: Beat up Martin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173120,
      "endMs": 176707
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Bah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180878,
      "endMs": 182213
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "All right, first academic alert: Wiggum, Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182505,
      "endMs": 185508
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "I won! I won!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 185675,
      "endMs": 188052
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "No. No, Ralph. This means you're failing English.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189637,
      "endMs": 192598
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Me fail English? That's \"unpossible.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192807,
      "endMs": 195851
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Muntz, Nelson. You're failing history, geography and math.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196060,
      "endMs": 200022
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "But you're doing quite well in home ec. Hey! Keep it down, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 200231,
      "endMs": 204235
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Simpson...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204402,
      "endMs": 205903
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "...Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206028,
      "endMs": 207655
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Grades are all I have. What could I be failing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207822,
      "endMs": 211200
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I'm smart and a teacher's pet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 211409,
      "endMs": 213494
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Gym?! That's the stupidest thing I ever heard!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 215413,
      "endMs": 220251
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Lisa, your father and I are very concerned about this warning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 228717,
      "endMs": 232012
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "I really hope you try harder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232220,
      "endMs": 234180
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "That's all of them. And I'm so proud you didn't try to forge my name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 234556,
      "endMs": 238435
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "How about a present, son?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238560,
      "endMs": 239936
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Well, I could use a new pair of hockey skates.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 240103,
      "endMs": 242188
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Done and done. That's not fair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242397,
      "endMs": 244399
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Why is Bart getting a present, and I'm getting chewed out?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 244608,
      "endMs": 247277
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Ah, the mysteries of life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247444,
      "endMs": 249654
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Tell you what, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249821,
      "endMs": 251072
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "I won't fail you if you join one of those Pee Wee teams outside the school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 251281,
      "endMs": 255118
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "You mean, where parents push kids into vicious competition...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255327,
      "endMs": 258121
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "...to compensate for their own failed dreams of glory?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258288,
      "endMs": 260707
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Look, I don't need this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260916,
      "endMs": 262417
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I inhaled my favorite whistle this morning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 262584,
      "endMs": 265503
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Children, that was our only ball. There'll be no team this year.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279935,
      "endMs": 284606
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Mom, this is really scary. I'm gonna get my first F ever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 290068,
      "endMs": 294489
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Cheer up. So you're not good at sports. It's a very small part of life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294656,
      "endMs": 298285
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Sports, sports, sports, sports Marge, Bart rides up in the front seat today because he's a good guy at sports.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298493,
      "endMs": 305500
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "I think Lisa needs to feel a little special tonight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305667,
      "endMs": 308253
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "How about letting her ride up front too?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308420,
      "endMs": 311298
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "I tried.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311840,
      "endMs": 313091
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Okay, son. Just remember to have fun out there today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315469,
      "endMs": 318430
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "And if you lose, I'll kill you! Oh, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 318555,
      "endMs": 323643
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "All right, Pigs, beat those Gougers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 330525,
      "endMs": 332152
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "I could've been equipment manager, but no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337157,
      "endMs": 340744
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Our goalie cannot stand up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351630,
      "endMs": 353757
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Tell you what, get some rope.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353924,
      "endMs": 355217
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Defense! Defense! Come on! You call that blowing!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370148,
      "endMs": 372609
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Oh, yes, we won! We won! We won!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375946,
      "endMs": 379366
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Unfortunately, since I bet on the other team...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379533,
      "endMs": 382202
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "...we won't be going for pizza.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382369,
      "endMs": 384162
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Well, boy, you won. So I'm gonna live up to my side of the agreement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386122,
      "endMs": 390543
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Here's your turtle, alive and well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390751,
      "endMs": 393295
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Aw, thanks, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393462,
      "endMs": 396090
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "How about some adulation from my little sister?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396757,
      "endMs": 398884
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Wow, Bart, I'm so impressed you were able to give Milhouse a concussion.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 399051,
      "endMs": 402513
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Aw, you're just jealous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402721,
      "endMs": 404306
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Because... you... stink... at... sports!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404473,
      "endMs": 408727
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Cut it out, Bart! What the...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408894,
      "endMs": 410646
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "You know, I wonder if her skills will transfer over to the game of hockey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412732,
      "endMs": 417278
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Well, only one way to be sure. Heads up, little girl!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417445,
      "endMs": 421532
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "The goalie of my dreams!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424535,
      "endMs": 426537
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Let's try a hard one to make sure it wasn't a fluke.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428706,
      "endMs": 431417
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Hey! Way to knock out my teeth!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434003,
      "endMs": 437465
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Yeah, that's it, Milhouse. Keep up the chatter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 437631,
      "endMs": 440009
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Lisa, if the Bible has taught us nothing else, and it hasn't...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 443497,
      "endMs": 447709
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "...it's that girls should stick to girl sports.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447876,
      "endMs": 450253
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Such as hot oil wrestling, foxy boxing and such and such.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450420,
      "endMs": 454424
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "I think women should be able to play any sport men play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454633,
      "endMs": 457177
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "But hockey is so violent and dangerous. Look at Milhouse's teeth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457344,
      "endMs": 461223
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Mom, will you stop showing us those?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461390,
      "endMs": 463100
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "I have to join the team or I'll get an F...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463225,
      "endMs": 465268
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "...that will haunt me for the rest of my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465435,
      "endMs": 468021
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "I now pronounce you president of these United...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469064,
      "endMs": 472192
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Stop the inauguration! I just discovered our president-elect...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472359,
      "endMs": 475570
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "...got an F in second-grade gym class!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 475737,
      "endMs": 477531
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "In that case, I sentence you to a lifetime of horror on Monster Island.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478991,
      "endMs": 483745
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Don't worry. It's just a name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483870,
      "endMs": 485580
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He said it was just a name!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489710,
      "endMs": 492004
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "What he meant is that Monster Island is actually a peninsula.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493370,
      "endMs": 496415
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Do you have my teeth?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499960,
      "endMs": 502338
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503923,
      "endMs": 505174
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Okay, hotshots. Now that my daughter is on your team...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508469,
      "endMs": 511305
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "...I want to make a few things clear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511472,
      "endMs": 513516
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Please, Dad. I'll be fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513724,
      "endMs": 515601
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "I don't want anyone to give her a hard time just because she's different.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517061,
      "endMs": 521106
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "No jokes, no taunting...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521273,
      "endMs": 523400
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Look! That kid's got bosoms! Who's got a wet towel?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524193,
      "endMs": 527071
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Come here, you butterball.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528113,
      "endMs": 530324
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Don't make me run! I'm full of chocolate!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530533,
      "endMs": 533619
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "I can't watch. I don't know how you two can sit here...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 541669,
      "endMs": 544171
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "...laughing at poor Lisa while she's probably scared to death.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544338,
      "endMs": 547132
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "We're laughing with her, Marge. There's a big difference.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547299,
      "endMs": 552263
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "With her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 558175,
      "endMs": 559468
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "You really think I did okay out there, Mom?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559635,
      "endMs": 561679
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Absolutely, honey. By blocking the net, I really think you helped your team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561887,
      "endMs": 566225
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Okay, little buddy. Hop in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567134,
      "endMs": 569011
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "I mean my little girl buddy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570554,
      "endMs": 572723
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "That's very nice, but it's wrong for you to reward violent, competitive behavior.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 572932,
      "endMs": 576978
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "However, I will sit up front with you if it's a fatherly gesture of love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577144,
      "endMs": 580565
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Okay, hon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580773,
      "endMs": 582233
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Sucker! Competitive violence, that's why you're here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582400,
      "endMs": 585653
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "We're having our best season ever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606007,
      "endMs": 608259
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "And I would like to say that it is because of teamwork.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608467,
      "endMs": 612138
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Gee, who am I kidding, huh? It's all because of Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612346,
      "endMs": 614974
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Let's hear it for Lisa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 615182,
      "endMs": 617268
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Hey, Bart. If Lisa's better than you at hockey...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619437,
      "endMs": 622607
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "...does that mean you're gonna become better than her at school?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 622815,
      "endMs": 626360
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Maybe I will, Milhouse. Maybe I will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626736,
      "endMs": 632366
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Who can tell me the capital of Spain? Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636912,
      "endMs": 639539
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "The square root of 36? Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639706,
      "endMs": 642834
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Who freed the slaves? Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643001,
      "endMs": 645253
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Bart Simpson. Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 645503,
      "endMs": 647756
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Bart Simpson, stop raising your hand. You haven't had one right answer today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647923,
      "endMs": 651635
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651843,
      "endMs": 653386
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "This is for wasting teacher's valuable time!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653762,
      "endMs": 656765
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Lay off, guys! He's with me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659643,
      "endMs": 662270
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "It's a lucky coincidence you happen to be your sister's brother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662729,
      "endMs": 666316
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Don't worry, Bart. They won't bother you anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666483,
      "endMs": 669361
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "I hardly ever let Mother fight for me anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 672906,
      "endMs": 675575
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Sorry, Bart. I'm gonna hang out with Lisa...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675784,
      "endMs": 678703
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "...for protection...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678870,
      "endMs": 680247
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "...and to be seen!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680413,
      "endMs": 682624
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Come watch TV with me, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685701,
      "endMs": 686994
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "We missed the first two Cops, but if we hurry, we can catch the last three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687203,
      "endMs": 690706
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Oh, sorry, Bart. Lisa and I are going out for gelato.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690873,
      "endMs": 693793
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "We'd ask you to come, but...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693960,
      "endMs": 696212
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "...you know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 696379,
      "endMs": 697630
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Bart, I can spend some time with you. I don't know, Mom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699548,
      "endMs": 702677
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Don't have a stereotypical view of me just because I'm your mother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702843,
      "endMs": 705930
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "I know. How about we play the basketball?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 706097,
      "endMs": 709350
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "I'm no Harvey Globetrotter, but...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709517,
      "endMs": 712520
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Hey, Milhouse! Knock him down if he's in your way!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713794,
      "endMs": 716463
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Jimbo, Jimbo! Go for the face!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 716672,
      "endMs": 718132
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Look! Ralph Wiggum lost his shinguard!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718340,
      "endMs": 721051
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Hack the bone! Hack the bone!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721260,
      "endMs": 723971
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Wow! Eye of the tiger! Mouth of a teamster!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 724179,
      "endMs": 727433
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "To think of all the time I wasted on you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 727725,
      "endMs": 731729
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Well, not wasted...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732313,
      "endMs": 735190
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "I love you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735357,
      "endMs": 737192
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Let me give my special little winner a big, big hug.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738110,
      "endMs": 741864
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Ma. I think I'm all hugged out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742072,
      "endMs": 745576
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Ah, one more.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745701,
      "endMs": 747912
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Hello, Queen Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752082,
      "endMs": 753334
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Bart! What are you doing in my room?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754300,
      "endMs": 755969
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Lisa, certain differences, rivalries if you will, have come up between us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756177,
      "endMs": 760432
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "At first, I thought we could talk it over like civilized people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760598,
      "endMs": 763810
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "But instead, I just ripped the head off Mr. Honey Bunny!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763977,
      "endMs": 768982
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Bart, that was your cherished childhood toy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769190,
      "endMs": 771401
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Mr. Honey Bunny!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772360,
      "endMs": 774529
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Quiet down, Bart! Bart, just get out of here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777032,
      "endMs": 779451
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "It's a free country. You get out. That doesn't make sense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 779659,
      "endMs": 782370
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "I know you are, but what am I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782579,
      "endMs": 784080
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Get out! Get out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784289,
      "endMs": 785540
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Okay! But on my way, I'm gonna be doing this: If you get hit, it's your own fault.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785707,
      "endMs": 795008
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Okay. Then I'm gonna start kicking air like this: And if any part of you should fill that air, it's your own fault.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795216,
      "endMs": 804351
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "I better go check that out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 815043,
      "endMs": 816503
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Now, Homer, don't you eat this pie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816712,
      "endMs": 820466
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820966,
      "endMs": 822426
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "All right, pie, I'm just gonna do this:",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822593,
      "endMs": 824928
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "And if you get eaten, it's your own fault.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826847,
      "endMs": 828974
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Oh, my...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 833270,
      "endMs": 835272
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Oh, the hell with it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835439,
      "endMs": 837441
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Stop it! Stop it, stop it, stop it! Stop it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840569,
      "endMs": 844948
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Mom, that is really annoying.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845157,
      "endMs": 846450
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Bart started it. Lisa started it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846617,
      "endMs": 848577
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "I don't care who started it! I don't want to see you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 848786,
      "endMs": 851288
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "...fighting like that ever again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851497,
      "endMs": 852998
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "We love you both. You're not in competition with each other.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854165,
      "endMs": 857084
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Repeat, you are not in competition with each other.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857251,
      "endMs": 860797
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Hey! Apu just called. This Friday, Lisa's team is playing Bart's team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860963,
      "endMs": 865426
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "You're in direct competition!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865593,
      "endMs": 867261
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Don't go easy on each other because you're brother and sister.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867428,
      "endMs": 870223
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "I want to see you both fighting for your parents' love!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 870389,
      "endMs": 873726
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Fight! Fight! Fight!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873893,
      "endMs": 878356
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Okay, I'm gonna make a little deal with you mugs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 880860,
      "endMs": 883113
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "I'm gonna let you out to see my team play the game...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883321,
      "endMs": 885740
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "...if you promise to return to your cells.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885907,
      "endMs": 887867
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Sorry, pig. We can't make that promise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888034,
      "endMs": 891371
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "All right. All right, I'll sweeten the deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891579,
      "endMs": 893832
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "You can see the game, you don't have to come back...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893998,
      "endMs": 896376
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "...but you have to promise not to commit any more crimes, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 896543,
      "endMs": 900421
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "No. I'll take that as a yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 900630,
      "endMs": 903508
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "All right, we're free!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903675,
      "endMs": 905844
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "You'll have to do better than that tonight, chump.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911657,
      "endMs": 914910
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "I asked for ketchup! I'm eating salad here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 916036,
      "endMs": 919915
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "I won't have any aggressive condiment-passing in this house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920124,
      "endMs": 923127
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Hello. Moe, what are you doing here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923752,
      "endMs": 925796
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "What? What? A bartender can't come by and say hi to his best customer?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926004,
      "endMs": 929717
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Hey, hey there, Midge. Oh, gee, I like what you done to your hair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 929883,
      "endMs": 933303
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "You caught me at a real bad time, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933512,
      "endMs": 935305
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "I hope you understand I'm too tense to pretend I like you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935472,
      "endMs": 938100
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Yeah, and how are the little kids doing? I mean, really, how are they doing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938308,
      "endMs": 941687
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Any disabling injuries? Something that the gambling community...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941854,
      "endMs": 944898
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "...might not yet know about? Here, let me see those knees.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945065,
      "endMs": 947651
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Moe, I think you should leave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 947818,
      "endMs": 949236
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "But Blanche, you gotta help me out here! Please! I'm 64 grand in the hole!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949445,
      "endMs": 952906
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "They're gonna take my thumbs!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953115,
      "endMs": 955075
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Charge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957244,
      "endMs": 959705
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Good luck tonight, sis. I'll try not to hurt you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961305,
      "endMs": 964851
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Don't worry. I'm wearing my lucky rabbit's head.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965017,
      "endMs": 968855
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Mr. Honey Bunny! You inhumane monster!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969021,
      "endMs": 971357
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "You want a piece of me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971524,
      "endMs": 973651
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Hey, hey. Stop it, stop it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973818,
      "endMs": 975570
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Conserve your precious hatred for the game.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975736,
      "endMs": 977738
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Now that we're all alone, Marge, admit it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977947,
      "endMs": 980116
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "You like Lisa best. No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980283,
      "endMs": 981951
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Oh, so you're a Bart woman, are you? No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982118,
      "endMs": 984328
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "You can't possible like Maggie best. What has she ever done?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984495,
      "endMs": 987331
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Nothing for nobody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987498,
      "endMs": 989292
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Homer, we can't root for one child over the other.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989500,
      "endMs": 991752
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "You wouldn't like it if the kids played favorites with us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991919,
      "endMs": 994547
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Hey, Mom! Look at me, Mom! Hi, Mom, over here! Mom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 994714,
      "endMs": 999093
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Hi, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999760,
      "endMs": 1001012
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "And now to honor America, here's Krusty the Clown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1001220,
      "endMs": 1005391
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Shouldn't have turned down those cue cards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1020656,
      "endMs": 1023534
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "I love Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1036546,
      "endMs": 1037797
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "No, wait! I love Lisa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1043052,
      "endMs": 1044929
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Beer? Oh, Marge, I love you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1045096,
      "endMs": 1047724
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "He tripped my boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072540,
      "endMs": 1074042
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "I demand vengeance! I want vengeance!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1074208,
      "endMs": 1077378
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Jimbo Jones called for tripping.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077879,
      "endMs": 1080590
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "A penalty shot will be taken by Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1080798,
      "endMs": 1083593
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Oh, my God. A penalty shot with only four seconds left.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1085720,
      "endMs": 1088306
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "It's your child versus mine! The winner will be showered with praise!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089673,
      "endMs": 1092843
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "The loser will be taunted and booed until my throat is sore!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093009,
      "endMs": 1096513
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Kill her, boy! Kill her!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101017,
      "endMs": 1102310
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Stop him dead, little girl!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103311,
      "endMs": 1104855
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Kill, Bart! Kill, Bart! Kill, Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105063,
      "endMs": 1107774
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Kill Bart! Kill Bart! Kill Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107941,
      "endMs": 1110944
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115282,
      "endMs": 1118493
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Great game, Lis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1165123,
      "endMs": 1166708
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Great game, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1166875,
      "endMs": 1169294
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Tie game?! What the hell?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174515,
      "endMs": 1176225
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "This is outrageous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176391,
      "endMs": 1177643
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Oh, I've never been so proud of them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177810,
      "endMs": 1181688
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "They're both losers. Losers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1184733,
      "endMs": 1187569
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "Rip off! We paid for blood!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187778,
      "endMs": 1190989
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Let's tear this place apart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1191198,
      "endMs": 1192950
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Good idea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1193158,
      "endMs": 1194868
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Those kids are, like, so sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200040,
      "endMs": 1203877
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "If only they had had Pee Wee hockey when I was a lad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1204670,
      "endMs": 1209383
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Oh, well. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1210259,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 8
  }
}
